<section class="container mx-auto mt-15">
  <div
    class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-4 sm:gap-4 lg:grid-cols-8 lg:gap-8"
  >
    <div class="col-span-4 sm:col-span-5 lg:col-span-3 lg:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Let's talk Retail Media</h2>
      <p class="mt-18 text-xl">
        Use the calendar to schedule a call with one of our experts.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold">In one call we'll walk you through:</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        <li class="flex">
          <span class="text-accent-dark text-xl sm:mt-1">▼</span>
          <p class="ml-2 text-lg">
            How to stop juggling multiple platforms and run campaigns from one
            place
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex">
          <span class="text-accent-dark text-xl sm:mt-1">▼</span>
          <p class="ml-2 text-lg">
            Getting clear, consolidated performance data without the guesswork
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex">
          <span class="text-accent-dark text-xl sm:mt-1">▼</span>
          <p class="ml-2 text-lg">
            What getting started actually looks like - and how quickly you can
            see results
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div
      class="col-span-4 mb-12 h-[720px] sm:col-span-3 lg:col-span-5 lg:p-6 lg:pb-0 2xl:mb-0"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center 2xl:items-start">
        <div
          class="relative w-full rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 pb-0 2xl:top-[-95px] 2xl:bg-transparent 2xl:pt-0"
        >
